		{"id":"g_pink-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟣 Darkner — **Mad Mew Mew (Pink)**\n**👪 Familia Blook**\n**🐱 Objeto Lightworld: figura Mew Mew**\n**🌑 Reino de las Flores, Cap.5**\n## Quinto portador del Cristal Oscuro, Cap.5.\n[[Mad Mew Mew (Pink)]]","x":-2340,"y":860,"width":340,"height":312,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"g_alvin-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Alvin**\n**🐢 Tortuga**\n**👪 Familia Boom**\n**⛪ Iglesia**\n## Párroco de Hometown; hijo de Gerson Boom.\n[[Alvin]]","x":491,"y":1240,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g21-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Asgore**\n**🐐 Cabra**\n**👪 Familia Dreemurr**\n**🌼 Floristería Flower King**\n## Padre de Kris y Asriel. Tritagonista Cap.5.\n[[Asgore]]","x":-2680,"y":-3236,"width":340,"height":296,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g20-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Toriel**\n**🐐 Cabra**\n**👪 Familia Dreemurr (ex)**\n**🎒 Escuela (profesora)**\n**⛪ Iglesia**\n## Madre de Kris y Asriel, ex-esposa de Asgore.\n[[Toriel]]","x":-1880,"y":-3544,"width":340,"height":304,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_7flores-cap","type":"text","text":"# ⚪ Tema — **7 Flores de Colores**\n**🌸 Ramo de bodas de Asgore y Toriel**\n## Aqua, Seth, Orange, Green, Yellow y Blue — espejo de las ALMAs de Undertale.\n[[7 Flores de Colores]]","x":-2980,"y":-4720,"width":300,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"g_gerson-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Gerson Boom**\n**🐢 Tortuga**\n**👪 Familia Boom**\n**🎓 Escuela (profesor, fallecido)**\n## Lightner fallecido, revivido como el Old Man en el Cap.4.\n[[Gerson Boom]]","x":-1585,"y":1880,"width":340,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_berdly-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Berdly**\n**🐦 Ave (cuervo/azulejo)**\n**🎒 Escuela**\n## Compañero de clase; aliado desde el Cap.2.\n[[Berdly]]","x":440,"y":-3201,"width":340,"height":261,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_sans-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Sans**\n**💀 Esqueleto**\n**👪 Hermano de Papyrus**\n**🌭 Vendedor (Festival)**\n## Esqueleto recién llegado a Hometown; personaje de Undertale.\n[[Sans]]","x":-840,"y":-4760,"width":340,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_papyrus-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Papyrus**\n**💀 Esqueleto**\n**👪 Hermano de Sans**\n## Hermano de Sans; nunca ha aparecido en persona.\n[[Papyrus]]","x":580,"y":-5340,"width":340,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g9-cap","type":"text","text":"# ⚪ Tema — **Profecía**\n**📜 Objeto / texto**\n## Anuncia un sacrificio final.\n[[Profecía]]","x":341,"y":310,"width":340,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_jackenstein-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟣 Darkner — **Jackenstein**\n**🎃 Biblioteca, Santuario Oscuro (Cap.4)**\n## Su combate confirma que el alma de Kris y la del Jugador son distintas.\n[[Jackenstein]]","x":-680,"y":1020,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"g10-cap","type":"text","text":"# ⚪ Tema — **Conexión Undertale**\n**🔗 Concepto**\n## Universo paralelo confirmado por Toby Fox.\n[[Conexión Undertale]]","x":280,"y":-4320,"width":340,"height":280},
		{"id":"g0-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Kris**\n**🧑 Humano**\n**👪 Familia Dreemurr (adoptivo)**\n**🎒 Escuela**\n**🎮 Fun Gang**\n## ¿Quién controla realmente a Kris?\n[[Kris]]","x":-1200,"y":-1000,"width":340,"height":301,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_alphys-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Alphys**\n**🦎 Reptil**\n**🎒 Escuela (profesora)**\n## Profesora de Kris y Susie.\n[[Alphys]]","x":-4620,"y":-3100,"width":340,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g13-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Asriel**\n**🐐 Cabra**\n**👪 Familia Dreemurr**\n**🎓 Universidad**\n## De vuelta desde el Cap.4.\n[[Asriel]]","x":-380,"y":-2760,"width":340,"height":268,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_flowery-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟣 Darkner — **Flowery**\n**🌼 Objeto Lightworld: flor dorada**\n**🌑 Reino de las Flores, Cap.5**\n## Antagonista principal y jefe final del Cap.5.\n[[Flowery]]","x":-3760,"y":-3803,"width":340,"height":263,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"g_napstablook-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Napstablook**\n**👻 Fantasma**\n**👪 Familia Blook**\n**👮 Policía**\n## Policía de Hometown, junto a Undyne.\n[[Napstablook]]","x":-3400,"y":640,"width":340,"height":307,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_catti-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Catti**\n**🐈 Gato**\n**👪 Hermana menor de Catty**\n**🎒 Escuela**\n## Compañera de clase; sale con Jockington.\n[[Catti]]","x":-4800,"y":-760,"width":340,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g_undyne-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Undyne**\n**🐟 Pez**\n**👮 Policía (jefa)**\n## Jefa de policía; secuestrada por el Caballero en el Cap.3.\n[[Undyne]]","x":-3820,"y":-480,"width":340,"height":279,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g6-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Dess**\n**🦌 Reno**\n**👪 Familia Holiday**\n## Desaparecida antes del juego.\n[[Dess]]","x":2095,"y":-1836,"width":340,"height":256,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g16-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟡 Lugar — **Lake**\n## El gran cabo suelto del Cap.5.\n[[Lake]]","x":1760,"y":-355,"width":340,"height":173,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"g5-cap","type":"text","text":"# ⚪ Tema — **Forgotten Man**\n**👤 Personaje enigmático**\n## Reparte un Huevo por capítulo; Kris es el único que lo recuerda.\n[[Forgotten Man]]","x":2620,"y":-820,"width":340,"height":280},
		{"id":"g25-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Onionsan**\n**🦑 Cefalópodo**\n## NPC del Lago. Desaparece desde el Cap.4.\n[[Onionsan]]","x":2534,"y":600,"width":340,"height":262,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"g19-cap","type":"text","text":"# ⚪ Tema — **Cristal Oscuro**\n**📦 5 objetos, 1 por capítulo (Cap.1-5)**\n**🗽 Tema: la libertad**\n**💭 Cap.5: son \"sueños fallidos\"**\n## Jefes secretos que buscan libertad — Seam guarda los 5.\n[[Cristal Oscuro]]","x":1226,"y":1838,"width":340,"height":269,"color":"#6b7280"},
		{"id":"g_conexiones-cap","type":"text","text":"# Conexiones (detalle)\n## Explicación completa de cada línea del corcho.\n[[Conexiones del Corcho]]","x":800,"y":3162,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"6b7280"},
		{"id":"hub","type":"text","text":"# Corcho de teorías\n**Deltarune**\n\nCada tarjeta = sprite/imagen + nota rápida.\nDoble clic en el texto de abajo para abrir la teoría completa.\n\nVer `00 Índice.md` para la leyenda de colores.","x":1259,"y":3162,"width":401,"height":238,"color":"6"},
