		{"id":"g_clamgirl-cap","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Lightner — **Clam Guy**\n**🐚 Monstruo (almeja)**\n## Regresa de Undertale; comparte diseño con Clam Girl.\n[[Clam Guy]]","x":5789,"y":-4265,"width":331,"height":284,"color":"4"},
